    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McWey Auctioneers are delighted to present No. 143 Pierce Lodge to the market.\r\n\r\nIdeally located within the highly regarded Pierce Lodge development, this attractive ground-floor apartment offers comfortable and contemporary living in a convenient and well-established setting. The development is within easy walking distance of Newbridge Railway Station and all the amenities that Newbridge town has to offer.\r\n\r\nPierce Lodge is a well-maintained and professionally managed development, with secure access and ample resident parking.\r\n\r\nNo. 143 is a bright and well-proportioned apartment, boasting a spacious and thoughtfully designed layout. Upon entering, you are welcomed by a generous hallway with excellent built-in storage. The hallway leads through to the impressive open-plan kitchen/dining/living area, which provides access to a private, enclosed balcony. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation further comprises a spacious, fully tiled bathroom with a quality fitted suite, along with two generous bedrooms, both benefiting from fitted wardrobes. The master bedroom also enjoys the added benefit of a private ensuite.\r\n\r\nOffering a superb combination of space, convenience and security, No. 143 Pierce Lodge would make an ideal home for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors alike."
      },
